@M_KOJO_ENCOUNTER_K47
;初対面、挨拶のタイミング
;TALENTの変更はここでどうぞ。
	PRINTFORML
	PRINTFORMDL As you look around, you notice a twin-tailed short brunette walking briskly towards you, carrying a box of tools and a roll of paper,
	PRINTFORMDW while muttering something to herself.
	PRINTFORMDW She stops just before walking right into you, and looks up, blinking a few times, before she curtly remarks: 
	PRINTFORMW 「You're a new face. Another human, huh. Guessing you're new around here. You'd better stay away from the Hakurei Shrine 
	PRINTFORML if you know what's good for you. Nothing but a Youkai Hideout. Actually, just stay away from religion 
	PRINTFORMW in Gensokyo. Magic isn't much better. Only thing you can trust is science and technology.」
	PRINTFORMDW The girl waves the roll of paper under your nose.
	PRINTFORML 「Name's Rika. Just Rika. I'm an engineer. Better than any damn Kappa or that self-proclaimed 'Technology Goddess'.
	PRINTFORMW Youkai and Gods thinking they can match human ingenuity.」
	PRINTFORMDW The girl scoffs. It's quickly apparent she is no fan of Youkai, magic, faith or Gods. 
	PRINTFORMDW She waits expectantly, and you introduce yourself.
	PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%, huh? You don't seem to be a weirdo like most of the others here. Don't go proving me wrong.」
	PRINTFORMDL You're not quite sure what she means by "weirdo". From what you've seen of Gensokyo, she seems to be the weird one.
	PRINTFORMDW A girl who seems to defy all the norms of this world. 
	PRINTFORML
RETURN 1
